(F5 T2 V5b: global_element_dof_from_node_dof -no (manual Professional 6.554)
 on a quad4 with node_dof stresses in the input and no element_intpnt_dof:
 the integration points start from zero stress, so the result is the one of
 a model without initial stress. Expected node_dof 1..4 (scripts/build_safe.sh):
 Professional 02-08-2026 probe f5/v5b d_no (same input).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
node_dof 1 0. 0. 0. 0. -10. 1. 0. -20. 0. -5.
node_dof 2 0. 0. 0. 0. -10. 1. 0. -20. 0. -5.
node_dof 3 0. 0. 0. 0. -12. 1. 0. -22. 0. -5.
node_dof 4 0. 0. 0. 0. -12. 1. 0. -22. 0. -5.
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 3 3 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 1 4 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
global_element_dof_from_node_dof -no
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
